  "id": "sandy-city-open-data",
  "title": "Sandy City, Utah \u2014 Municipal Open Data",
  "updated": "2026-10-07T21:32:21Z",
  "description": "A cloud-native mirror of the public geospatial data published by Sandy City, Utah: parcels, zoning, addresses, boundaries, parks and trails, public safety districts, water and storm infrastructure, roads and transit. Sandy City serves this data from a public ArcGIS Server and an ArcGIS Online organization, but runs no open data portal, publishes no bulk downloads, and states no license. This catalog republishes the public-interest subset as GeoParquet and PMTiles so it can be queried, joined and mapped without reverse-engineering REST pagination. Sandy City produced the data; this catalog is an independent mirror and is not endorsed by the city. Read the [agent guide](AGENTS.md) before querying, and read each collection's README for what its columns mean and what is known to be wrong with them.",
